    "topic_id": 488535,
    "poster_id": 1991,
    "post_rendered": "Determine all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db7b42a61095556ced1af91db9457c2a5c442b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f,g)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" > of functions from the set of real numbers to itself that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a3bc25299a0bcbd3f3602a0e6881d68fce750c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g(f(x+y)) = f(x) + (2x + y)g(y)\\]\"  width=\"269\" height=\"18\" > for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > and <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\n<i>Proposed by Japan</i>",
    "post_canonical": "Determine all pairs $(f,g)$ of functions from the set of real numbers to itself that satisfy \\[g(f(x+y)) = f(x) + (2x + y)g(y)\\] for all real numbers $x$ and $y$.\n\n[i]Proposed by Japan[/i]",
    "username": "orl",
    "post_number": 1,
